  "notes": [
    "Fully regular reflexive -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: quedado (regular)",
    "*Quedarse en casa* = to stay at home; *¿Te quedas a cenar?* = Are you staying for dinner?",
    "Also used with adjectives: *quedarse tranquilo* = to stay calm, *quedarse dormido* = to fall asleep, *quedarse parado* = to freeze/stop",
    "Non-reflexive *quedar* = to be left/remain (e.g. *quedan dos días* = there are two days left), or to arrange to meet (*quedamos el martes* = we're meeting Tuesday)"
  ],
